        <activityName xml:lang="en">Yarn, kenaf, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Yarn, kenaf, at plant
Inventory refers to 1 kg yarn produced from ckenaf fibres;
UUID: 78c9905a-84a2-3261-afff-efe171fd5f51
The inventories include the cultivation of kenaf fibres and its processing to yarn (opening, batching, cardening, combing, spinning). 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Cultivation, harvest and retting of bast fibres and the further opening, batching, cardening, combing and spinning are the main processes of the yarn production. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume:  
Sampling: Data are from expert interviews and from literature.  
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_78c9905a-84a2-3261-afff-efe171fd5f51.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
